Throw a vial of volatile liquid that explodes in a radius 2 cloud of smoke lasting [3, 4, 5, 5, 5 (TL1-5)] turns.  The smoke blocks line of sight, and enemies within will have their vision range reduced by [1, 2, 3, 4, 6 (TL1-5)].

Use of this talent will not break stealth, and creatures affected by the smokes can never prevent you from activating stealth, even if their proximity would normally forbid it.

Prepared with: not prepared
